    },
    "Deleting an album keeps its photos in your library. A folder can only be deleted after everything inside it is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除相簿不會刪掉照片，照片仍然留在圖庫裡。資料夾要先把裡面的相簿全部刪除，才能刪除資料夾。"
